WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.677
[Gentle music]
SharpLsp brings a NuGet browser into VS Code. Right-click a project, F# or C#, and choose Browse NuGet Packages.

00:24.117 --> 00:30.217
Search nuget.org, and pick a package to see its description, license, versions and tags.

00:47.683 --> 00:54.269
Install edits the project file through MSBuild, keeping its formatting, then restores in the background.

00:54.819 --> 01:01.103
Now it's under Installed, and the project file has its package reference. No terminal, no guesswork.
